  "description": "These running boards made by YITAMOTOR are OE quality, with drop design and anti-slip design. They can better protect your vehicle from scratch and are easy to clean thanks to their anti-corrosion steel material.\nFitment\n2019-2026 RAM 1500 New Body Crew Cab\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit:\nYITAMOTOR side steps are specifically built for 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023\n2024 2026 RAM 1500 New Body Crew Cab (4 Full-Size Doors, Not Fit\nClassic style); Confirm the product is compatible with your vehicle\nbefore purchase\nPerformant Design: YITAMOTOR running boards merge extra-long drop steps\nwith a rugged texture finish to achieve a distinct off-road look; The\n3D pattern on 4.7-inch step pads provides stable footing and minimal\nslippage, while also providing space to wipe off your boots\nSupreme Functionality: These step bars help protect your truck rocker\npanels from debris and reduce collision impact to the doors\n500 lbs. capacity: Fine textured powder coating offers exceptional rust\nand corrosion resistance so you can drive in any weather and on any\nroad; Heavy duty all-steel nerf bars can handle more than 500 lbs. load\ncapacity on each side\nEasy Installation: Direct bolt-on installation with no drilling needed;\nAll mounting hardware and installation instructions are included\nProfessional installation recommended",
